    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the Finnish purgatory \u2013 Tuonela \u2013 and fight the countless other versions of yourself to prove worthy of ascending back onto the Earth.<br><br>Explore the open world, gather resources, craft better equipment to prepare for battle.<br><br>But choose your fights wisely as the three hit combat can take even a seasoned Shadow by surprise. <br><br>Tuonela remembers only the triumphant.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to the Finnish purgatory \u2013 Tuonela \u2013 and fight the countless other versions of yourself to prove worthy of ascending back onto the Earth.<br><br>Explore the open world, gather resources, craft better equipment to prepare for battle.<br><br>But choose your fights wisely as the three hit combat can take even a seasoned Shadow by surprise. <br><br>Tuonela remembers only the triumphant.</p>",
    "short_description": "Shadows of Tuonela is a fantasy multiplayer game blending high-intensity PvP with chill PvE point-and-click gameplay. Prepare for battle in the mystical purgatory of Tuonela \u2014 explore, gear up, face epic monsters, and rise as the greatest Shadow in the realm.",
